WEBVTT

00:06:59.223 --> 00:07:00.814
I should say former friend.

00:07:00.838 --> 00:07:02.098
(Laughter)

00:07:02.649 --> 00:07:04.802
I remember it was a group of us outside,

00:07:04.826 --> 00:07:06.664
and he had ran up

00:07:06.688 --> 00:07:10.159
and he had the stereotypical
brown paper bag in his hand,

00:07:10.183 --> 00:07:11.818
and I knew what it was,

00:07:11.842 --> 00:07:15.472
and so I'm a very mouthy person,
and I started going off.

00:07:15.496 --> 00:07:17.690
I was like, "What are you
doing with a gun?

00:07:18.325 --> 00:07:19.971
You're not going to shoot anyone.

00:07:19.995 --> 00:07:22.469
You're a coward, you don't
even know how to use it."

00:07:22.493 --> 00:07:24.255
And I kept going on

00:07:24.279 --> 00:07:25.470
and on

00:07:25.494 --> 00:07:26.747
and on,

00:07:26.771 --> 00:07:28.758
and he got angrier

00:07:28.782 --> 00:07:30.428
and angrier